<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45199" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὔστροφος</span></b> , 
			Ep.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐΰστρ</span>-, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>well-twisted</i>,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐϋστρόφῳ οἰὸς ἀώτῳ</span> with
				<i>well-twisted</i> wool (i.e. a sling), <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				13.599
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				716
			</span></i> (
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐϋστρεφεῖ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aristarch.
				</span></i>
			). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>easily turned, manageable</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νῆες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>IA</u>
					293
				</span></i>
			 (
				Sup.
			, lyr.); <i>turning easily on a pivot</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hero
				<u>Aut.</u>
				26.2
			</span></i>: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζῷον</span>, of man,
				<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Criti.</u>
				109c
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς τὰς ἀπαντήσεις εὔ. λόγος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.803f
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ εὔ. τοῦ φθέγματος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>VS</u>
					2.10.5
				</span></i>
			. Adv. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φως</span>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, τέθριππον ἕλκων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>APl.</u>
					4.385
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Alex.Trall.
				1.16
			</span></i>.</div>
